+
+## Pioneer local runtime (fork contract 2.9)
+
+The Pioneer fork adds `pioneer_local` to Jev and planner providers. Its only
+plaintext origin is `http://10.88.0.1:12500`, with Jev at `/v1/systemone`
+and GLM at `/v1`. Tenant identity is the existing scoped key. Other private
+origins and hosted fallback are refused for this provider. Optional
+`browser.headless: false` launches the browser visibly on the tenant display.
+These are Pioneer modifications, not an upstream release.
